<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SpellBound Books | Contact</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/spellbound_books.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container-about">
      <div class="aboutUs">
        <h1>Our Mission</h1>
        <p>
          Spellbound Books is a cozy place for book lovers located in Lincoln
          Park, Chicago. We believe that reading should be for everyone, no
          matter their background, experience, or skill level. Whether you’re an
          avid reader, just starting your reading journey, or rediscovering the
          joy of books, we’re here to support and inspire you. Our carefully
          curated selection includes stories for all ages, interests, and
          reading levels, ensuring that every visitor finds something to enjoy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Beyond offering books, we are dedicated to building a welcoming and
          inclusive community of readers. We host book clubs, reading events,
          and discussions to bring people together through the power of reading.
          Our space is designed to be a gathering place where ideas are
          exchanged, friendships are formed, and a love for literature is able
          to grow. Everyone is welcome here, whether you’re looking for
          recommendations, a quiet place to read, or a somewhere to share your
          passion for books with others.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a small, independent bookstore, we take pride in providing a
          personal and meaningful connection with our customers. We believe that
          books have the power to change lives, open minds, and bring people
          closer together. Our mission is simple: to make reading accessible,
          enjoyable, and enriching for all people. Thank you for being a part of
          our journey, we can’t wait to share our love of books with you!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="forum-text">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p>
          Have suggestions, queries, or want to talk about books? You've come to
          the right place! If you need help with an order, shipping issues, or
          finding a location we are here to help. Contact us using the form
          below, or get involved in our forum to converse with other book
          lovers. We look forward to hearing from you!
        </p>
      </div>
      <form action="/question" method="POST">
        <label for="name">Name:</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required /><br />

        <label for="email">Email:</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required /><br />

        <label for="inquiry">Message:</label>
        <textarea type="text" id="inquiry" name="inquiry" required></textarea><br />

        <button type="submit">Submit</button>
      </form>

    
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
